OL,3,GNEWSAPraise for way rescuers work in
OL,4,A'unique' islands
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst responders in the Isles of Scilly
OL,7,Fhave been praised for having
OL,8,F"exceptionally strong working
OL,9,Frelationships" by national assessors.
OL,11,FAll of the emergency services in the
OL,12,Fislands were assessed to ensure
OL,13,Fagencies worked together in major
OL,14,Fincidents.
OL,16,FThe Joint Emergency Services
OL,17,FInteroperability Principles team said
OL,18,Fin its report teams demonstrated
OL,19,F"effective exercising, strong
OL,20,Foperational knowledge and a genuinely
OL,21,Fintegrated emergency response system"
OL,22,Fin a "unique operating environment".
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
