OL,3,GNEWSAPraise for way rescuers work in
OL,4,A'unique' islands
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsles of Scilly chief fire officer Phil
OL,7,FMartin said he was "incredibly proud",
OL,8,Fadding: "To have the national team come
OL,9,Facross, have a look at what we do and
OL,10,Fthen say what they did is just
OL,11,Funbelievable."
